    "turn_text": "conservative, the America first, the family values people in power. And they just aren't doing it. You are. You're trying a bunch of Republicans voted against this. But let me go back to what you first said, because this is not being reported by the media. And it's very easy to report this. There is no spending cut at all in this bill. If you go back to if you go back to pre COVID, The COVID was what? Pre-COVID, I think it was $4 trillion. With COVID, it's $6 trillion. So now we're cutting some spending from the $6 trillion. We never get back to four. So we're playing games here.",
